{"format":"rerail.policy/v1","id":"eslint-no-irregular-whitespace","revision":13,"mode":"steer","description":"Port of ESLint's `no-irregular-whitespace` (https://eslint.org/docs/latest/rules/no-irregular-whitespace). Reports every maximal run of irregular white space and every U+2028/U+2029 (`finding.each` over a regex group): inside the tokens ESLint does not skip (comments, regex literals, template chunks), between tokens through a lexer regex over the program's text and each template substitution's that consumes what is no code (comments, strings, templates, regex literals at the start or after a punctuator), and in the file's leading white space before the first token (its first three runs or line terminators). Options are declared in the `options` define (the rule's defaults); a variant is a config patch.","scope":{"include":["**/*"],"exclude":[]},"clauses":[{"id":"options","define":{"options":{"skipComments":{"type":"boolean","nullable":true,"default":null},"skipTemplates":{"type":"boolean","nullable":true,"default":null},"skipRegExps":{"type":"boolean","nullable":true,"default":null},"skipJSXText":{"type":"boolean","nullable":true,"default":null},"skipStrings":{"type":"boolean","nullable":true,"default":null}}}},{"id":"in-token","forbid":{"ast":{"language":"typescript","rule":{"any":[{"$option":"skipComments","cases":{"true":[]},"default":[{"kind":"comment"}],"spread":true},{"$option":"skipRegExps","cases":{"true":[]},"default":[{"kind":"regex"}],"spread":true},{"$option":"skipTemplates","cases":{"true":[]},"default":[{"kind":"string_fragment","inside":{"stopBy":"neighbor","kind":"template_string"}}],"spread":true},{"$option":"skipStrings","cases":{"false":[{"kind":"string"}]},"default":[],"spread":true}],"regex":"(?P<WS>[\\x0B\\x0C\\x{85}\\x{FEFF}\\x{A0}\\x{1680}\\x{180E}\\x{2000}-\\x{200B}\\x{202F}\\x{205F}\\x{3000}]+|[\\x{2028}\\x{2029}])"}}},"violation":{"anchor":"capture.WS","code":"no-irregular-whitespace","message":"Irregular whitespace not allowed.",